async function submitMarketMemoryPatch(){closeModal();await guarded('Auction memory patch',async()=>{const x=await api('marketPatchAuctionMemory',{});const r=resultOf(x)||{};const ok=(r.entries||[]).filter(e=>e.ok).length;toast(i18nFormat('message.memory_patch_result',{ok,total:(r.entries||[]).length||0,pid:r.pid||'-'}));return x})}
async function openPartyCompatDialog(){await guarded('Party',async()=>{const x=await fetch('/api/party-compat').then(r=>r.json());if(!x.ok)throw new Error(x.error||i18nFormat('error.status_failed'));const s=x.result||{};const detail=[i18nText(s.state||'-')];if(s.next_retry_sec)detail.push(i18nFormat('party.retry',{seconds:s.next_retry_sec}));if(s.fail_count)detail.push(i18nFormat('party.failures',{count:s.fail_count}));const msg=s.message?('<div class="muted" style="grid-column:1/-1">'+escapeHTML(i18nText(s.message))+'</div>'):'';const body='<div class="formgrid"><label>Desired</label><div>'+escapeHTML(i18nFormat(s.desired_enabled?'common.on':'common.off'))+'</div><label>Actual</label><div>'+escapeHTML(detail.join(' / '))+'</div><label>Game process</label><div>PID '+escapeHTML(s.pid||'-')+' / '+escapeHTML(i18nFormat('party.port',{port:s.port||'-'}))+'</div><label>Skills</label><label><input id="partySkillEnabled" type="checkbox" '+(s.skill_enabled?'checked':'')+'> Cast</label><label>Account start</label><input class="party-account-input" id="partyCompatStart" type="number" min="1" max="4294967295" value="'+escapeHTML(s.account_start||17000000)+'"><label>Account end</label><input class="party-account-input" id="partyCompatEnd" type="number" min="1" max="4294967295" value="'+escapeHTML(s.account_end||17001000)+'">'+msg+'</div>';showModal('Party',body,'<button onclick="submitPartyCompat(\'off\')">Off</button><button class="primary" onclick="submitPartyCompat(\'on\')">On</button>');return x})}
async function submitPartyCompat(action){const account_start=Math.floor(Number(byId('partyCompatStart').value||0)),account_end=Math.floor(Number(byId('partyCompatEnd').value||0)),skill_enabled=!!byId('partySkillEnabled')?.checked;if(!account_start||account_end<=account_start){toast(i18nFormat('result.failed',{action:i18nFormat('operation.party_patch'),error:i18nFormat('validation.account_range')}));return}closeModal();await guarded(i18nFormat('operation.party_patch')+' '+i18nFormat(action==='on'?'common.on':'common.off'),async()=>{const x=await fetch('/api/party-compat',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({action,account_start,account_end,skill_enabled})}).then(r=>r.json());if(!x.ok)throw new Error(x.error||i18nFormat('error.update_failed'));return x})}
async function openDiagnosticsDialog(){await guarded('Diagnostics',async()=>{const [x,p]=await Promise.all([fetch('/api/diagnostics').then(r=>r.json()),api('partyDebugStatus')]);showDiagnosticsDialog(x,resultOf(p)||{});return x})}
function statusPill(s,translate=true){s=String(s||'ok');const cls=s==='error'?'error':(s==='warn'?'warn':'ok');const label=translate?(s==='error'?i18nFormat('common.error'):(s==='warn'?i18nFormat('common.warn'):i18nFormat('common.ok'))):(s==='error'?'Error':(s==='warn'?'Warn':'OK'));return '<span class="pill '+cls+'">'+escapeHTML(label)+'</span>'}
function partyDebugActionsHTML(p){const state=String(p.state||'idle'),active=state==='capturing'||state==='analyzing',elapsed=Math.max(0,Number(p.elapsed_ms||0)),used=Math.max(0,Number(p.bytes_used||0));const status=state==='capturing'?('Capturing '+(elapsed/1000).toFixed(1)+'s · '+formatDebugBytes(used)):(state==='analyzing'?'Analyzing':'');return '<span class="diag-debug-state">'+escapeHTML(status)+'</span><button id="partyDebugStart" class="diagtextbtn" onclick="startPartyDebug()" '+(active?'disabled':'')+'>Start Party Debug</button><button id="partyDebugStop" class="diagtextbtn" onclick="stopPartyDebug()" '+(state==='capturing'?'':'disabled')+'>Stop &amp; Analyze</button>'}
function formatDebugBytes(value){if(value>=1048576)return (value/1048576).toFixed(2)+'MB';if(value>=1024)return (value/1024).toFixed(1)+'KB';return value+'B'}
function showDiagnosticsDialog(r,p){const sum=r.summary||{};let body='<div class="formgrid"><label>Generated</label><div>'+escapeHTML(r.generated_at||'-')+'</div><label>Summary</label><div>OK '+escapeHTML(sum.ok||0)+' / Warn '+escapeHTML(sum.warnings||0)+' / Error '+escapeHTML(sum.errors||0)+'</div></div>';for(const sec of (r.sections||[])){const actions=sec.name==='Party'?('<span id="partyDebugActions" class="diagpartyactions">'+partyDebugActionsHTML(p)+'</span>'):'';body+='<div class="diagsec"><div class="diaghead"><span>'+escapeHTML(sec.name||'-')+'</span>'+actions+'</div>';for(const c of (sec.checks||[])){body+='<div class="diagrow"><div>'+escapeHTML(c.name||'-')+'</div><div>'+statusPill(c.status,false)+'</div><div>'+escapeHTML(c.message||'')+'</div></div>'}body+='</div>'}showModal('Diagnostics',body,'<button onclick="closeModal()">Close</button>','diagnostics',false);setTimeout(()=>updatePartyDebugControls(p),0);schedulePartyDebugPoll(p)}
function updatePartyDebugControls(p){const el=byId('partyDebugActions');if(!el)return;el.innerHTML=partyDebugActionsHTML(p)}
function schedulePartyDebugPoll(p){if(partyDebugTimer){clearTimeout(partyDebugTimer);partyDebugTimer=null}const state=String(p.state||'');if(state!=='capturing'&&state!=='analyzing')return;partyDebugTimer=setTimeout(async()=>{try{const x=await api('partyDebugStatus'),next=resultOf(x)||{};if((next.state||'')==='ready'){showPartyDebugResult(next)}else{updatePartyDebugControls(next);schedulePartyDebugPoll(next)}}catch(e){const s=document.querySelector('.diag-debug-state');if(s)s.textContent='Status error: '+e.message}},1000)}
async function startPartyDebug(){const a=byId('partyDebugStart'),b=byId('partyDebugStop');if(a)a.disabled=true;if(b)b.disabled=true;try{const x=await api('partyDebugStart'),p=resultOf(x)||{};updatePartyDebugControls(p);schedulePartyDebugPoll(p)}catch(e){if(a)a.disabled=false;const s=document.querySelector('.diag-debug-state');if(s)s.textContent='Start failed: '+e.message}}
async function stopPartyDebug(){const b=byId('partyDebugStop');if(b)b.disabled=true;try{const x=await api('partyDebugStop');showPartyDebugResult(resultOf(x)||{})}catch(e){if(b)b.disabled=false;const s=document.querySelector('.diag-debug-state');if(s)s.textContent='Stop failed: '+e.message}}
function showPartyDebugResult(p){if(partyDebugTimer){clearTimeout(partyDebugTimer);partyDebugTimer=null}const report=(p.report_lines||[]).join('\n')||'No Party debug data was captured.';const body='<pre class="party-debug-result">'+escapeHTML(report)+'</pre>';showModal('Party Debug Result',body,'<button onclick="closeModal()">Close</button>','diagnostics',false)}
async function releaseDefaultKeypair(){closeModal();await guarded('Release Bundled Default Key',async()=>api('keypairReleaseDefault',{}))}
function downloadDefaultKeypair(){window.location='/api/keypair-download'}
function toggleAutoRefresh(){if(autoRefreshTimer){clearInterval(autoRefreshTimer);autoRefreshTimer=null}const el=byId('autoRefreshInterval');const v=el?.value;if(v)localStorage.setItem('tw_auto_refresh_interval',v);if(v&&v!=='off')autoRefreshTimer=setInterval(refreshQuiet,Number(v))}
function restoreAutoRefresh(){const saved=localStorage.getItem('tw_auto_refresh_interval');const el=byId('autoRefreshInterval');if(saved&&el&&[...el.options].some(o=>o.value===saved))el.value=saved;toggleAutoRefresh()}
i18nApply(document);refreshAll();restoreAutoRefresh();
